{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Kukudh lets out a gasp before trying to hide that they're watching.","created_at":"2021-07-26T15:59:47.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869247640590762074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"It is our business that I don't mean to publicly share like this, but I think there's been a great misunderstanding\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T15:59:49.718000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869247650493501470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She looks taken back \" What do you mean a love potion? Willow told me it was your idea to break up. She didn't tell me anything about that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:02:36.032000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T16:03:16.163000Z","id":"869248348065005569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"The Empire City's Got Talent event. Before the event she crafted a philter of love. I asked her what it was for and she said not to worry about it. The potion makes you fall in love with the first person you see for the next hour after you drink it. Eliza and her were having friendly conversations and she brought me and her to two chairs in front of her. *She drank it in front of us*. I still don't entirely understand why risking our relationship was worth doing like that but it's in the past now. I was the first person she locked eyes with. She put herself under the influence to see where the wind blows per se. It could've easily been Eliza and gone a lot worse. There's a few other reasons including outside interference, but that's the main reason it needed to come to an end. At least for now. \"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:06:45.248000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869249393352646668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"There's some things that we both need to work on separate of each other and that's what warranted the break up. I harbor no ill feelings or will towards her and still care about her well being greatly.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:08:47.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869249907444310076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Oh.....Finn I'm sorry. \" She feels real dumb \"I just thought.....I was not told the truth. All I was was that my sister was hurt and knew you were at fault. I'm sorry I should have asked more questions.  Sometimes my angry gets the better of me. It's been a long time since i have had anything that resembles a sister. I...I guess I just got over protective of her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:14:12.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869251270182060083","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
